&HEAD CHID='particle_contact_energy', TITLE='Three spheres resting in one floor cell of a thick slab: energy budget of contact conduction' /

Three steel spheres at 900, 700 and 500 C rest in the same 5 cm x 5 cm floor cell of an insulated slab. Radiation and
convection are off. The energy lost by the spheres must equal the energy gained by the floor cell.
WALL ENTHALPY of a particle already includes its weighting factor.

&MESH IJK=10,10,5, XB=0.0,0.5,0.0,0.5,0.0,0.25 /
&TIME T_END=300., DT=0.05 /
&MISC NOISE=F /
&RADI RADIATION=.FALSE. /

&MATL ID='SLAB', DENSITY=1000., CONDUCTIVITY=0.5, SPECIFIC_HEAT=1.0 /
&SURF ID='FLOOR', MATL_ID='SLAB', THICKNESS=0.02, BACKING='INSULATED', TMP_INNER=20., HEAT_TRANSFER_COEFFICIENT=0., COLOR='GRAY' /
&VENT MB='ZMIN', SURF_ID='FLOOR' /

&MATL ID='STEEL', DENSITY=7850., CONDUCTIVITY=45., SPECIFIC_HEAT=0.46 /
&SURF ID='S900', MATL_ID='STEEL', THICKNESS=0.005, GEOMETRY='SPHERICAL', TMP_INNER=900., HEAT_TRANSFER_COEFFICIENT=0. /
&SURF ID='S700', MATL_ID='STEEL', THICKNESS=0.005, GEOMETRY='SPHERICAL', TMP_INNER=700., HEAT_TRANSFER_COEFFICIENT=0. /
&SURF ID='S500', MATL_ID='STEEL', THICKNESS=0.005, GEOMETRY='SPHERICAL', TMP_INNER=500., HEAT_TRANSFER_COEFFICIENT=0. /
&PART ID='p900', SURF_ID='S900', HEAT_TRANSFER_COEFFICIENT_SOLID=500., SAMPLING_FACTOR=1 /
&PART ID='p700', SURF_ID='S700', HEAT_TRANSFER_COEFFICIENT_SOLID=500., SAMPLING_FACTOR=1 /
&PART ID='p500', SURF_ID='S500', HEAT_TRANSFER_COEFFICIENT_SOLID=500., SAMPLING_FACTOR=1 /
&INIT ID='i900', PART_ID='p900', XYZ=0.262,0.262,0.004, N_PARTICLES=1 /
&INIT ID='i700', PART_ID='p700', XYZ=0.288,0.262,0.004, N_PARTICLES=1 /
&INIT ID='i500', PART_ID='p500', XYZ=0.275,0.288,0.004, N_PARTICLES=1 /

&DEVC ID='H_900', QUANTITY='WALL ENTHALPY', INIT_ID='i900', RELATIVE=.TRUE., OUTPUT=.FALSE. /
&DEVC ID='H_700', QUANTITY='WALL ENTHALPY', INIT_ID='i700', RELATIVE=.TRUE., OUTPUT=.FALSE. /
&DEVC ID='H_500', QUANTITY='WALL ENTHALPY', INIT_ID='i500', RELATIVE=.TRUE., OUTPUT=.FALSE. /
&CTRL ID='particle loss', FUNCTION_TYPE='SUM', INPUT_ID='H_900','H_700','H_500' /
&DEVC ID='Particle loss', QUANTITY='CONTROL VALUE', CTRL_ID='particle loss', CONVERSION_FACTOR=-1., UNITS='kJ' /
&DEVC ID='Floor gain',    QUANTITY='WALL ENTHALPY', XYZ=0.275,0.275,0.0, IOR=3, RELATIVE=.TRUE. /

&TAIL /
